---LINES
var     = ipvx  -       -       -       -         "3.141593"
alt1    = ipax  -       -       -       -         "YES"
a2      = iax   -       -       -       -         "[x]"
mse     = ipmx  -       -       -       -         " Quit "
VAR     = gv - - - - " VAR "
ALT     = ga - - - - " ALT "
MSE     = gm - - - - " MSE "

common  = gm - - - - " common: "
page_n  = gm - - - - " page navigation: "
specia  = gm - - - - " special: "

---SCREEN                                                          
=LINLIB generic keyboard command/actions
                                                                              
+.common...............              .MSE.   .mse..... -select menu item:     
+          get help: .:HE...                                .:NL... or .:SP...
+      refresh page: .:RE...                                                  
+   exit/close page: .:EX...         .ALT.   .a2       -alter or toggle:      
+            cancel: .:CA...                             forward:      .:SP...
+         next line: .:TA...                             backward:     .:DE...
+                                                                             
+.page_n...............              .VAR.   .var..... -switch to edit:       
+  jump to 1st line: .:KH...                             keep content: .:SP...
+       - last line: .:KE...                             clear field:  .:DE...
+    next page/part: .:PD...                                                      
+    prev page/part: .:PU...    ."in edit mode"................. ."with prefix".  
+                               erase left from cursor:  .:DE...              
+.specia...............             erase below cursor:  .:KD...  .:PR .:DE...	   
+   commit,complete,                   erase up to end:           .:PR .:SP...    
+         next line: .:NL...    jump to 1st symbol:      .:KH...  .:PR .:AL...    
+                                 jump to end of text:   .:KE...  .:PR .:AR...    
+     option prefix: .:PR...    toggle Ins/Ovr mode:     .:KI...  .:PR .:PR...    
+                               
=LINLIB (c) 1986-1990,2020 vsv&team
---END                          
+."common"..........            .MSE.   .mse..... -------select menu item:
+."page navigation".            .VAR.   .var..... --------switch to edit: 
+."special".........                erase below cursor:  .:KD...  .:PR .:DE...
